    "whatItIs": "Squarespace is a design-led website platform with integrated commerce. US annual tiles commonly published after the 2025/2026 plan rename: Basic ~$16/mo, Core ~$23/mo, Plus ~$39/mo, Advanced ~$99/mo (monthly higher). Platform transaction fees on commerce/digital products decrease on higher tiers; card processing is separate. 14-day trial. Best for brand sites and curated catalogs — not Magento/Shopify-class ops depth. Research 2026-08-18; confirm live on squarespace.com/pricing.",
